\text{mm}=4\\,\\text{mm}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186446154 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105928 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b7b354-5f1a-5411-8dde-4255f14b127b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Measure of a Line Segment Using a Ruler"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0116267a-587a-59de-84d1-6ba467b65702" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/39/392b3af6a2e540510c8bb19350226faebe2d2a6183da015473ba5379a8a92d5d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446094} {:answer/id #uuid "0f3613bc-9742-5631-8d02-060c3a922a0e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7e/7e1e4e275358615bc16f935b940647936ee3aacebc37159722fe66f4e76111d2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446098} {:answer/id #uuid "23848e56-6172-5215-a36c-6b695ce1631c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3e/3eb6873410aad7b40e0d4264f3f8b5decfd7d12ee669f2f33e57809c15ba891e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446103} {:answer/id #uuid "4d405620-c6e1-5f40-949b-e1a20e883d48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/db/db68c45d5b5fdbe6ffbe4edc52739c338262444088357352f001b87d0d016f99.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446115} {:answer/id #uuid "dd82655e-5239-5814-8fad-6e29f4b3fccd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/50/5082919b9603186c3de8c64a98b447890978d3bda0f83a6c89869b2dec5e50bf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446132}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0116267a-587a-59de-84d1-6ba467b65702" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/39/392b3af6a2e540510c8bb19350226faebe2d2a6183da015473ba5379a8a92d5d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446094} :answer-field/id #uuid "e96f0d4d-c50a-5397-b977-dc8aea56fbc7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446145}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f3042f6b-9d86-5ac2-aea7-7fc852598853" :question/math-academy-id "q-53228" :question/problem "Which of the following pictures shows a line segment of $7.5\\,\\text{cm}$ long?" :question/worked-solution "Note that one of the points of each segment is aligned with the zero-mark on the ruler.\n\nWe will use the rulers to determine which segment has a length of $7.5\\,\\text{cm}.$ To do this, we need to find a picture where the value that corresponds to the second point gives us exactly $7.5.$\n\nThe correct option is the following.\n\n![](images/39/392b3af6a2e540510c8bb19350226faebe2d2a6183da015473ba5379a8a92d5d.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186446153 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105927 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5c92ac26-24aa-5b82-8689-a30b23f05bfe" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Measure of a Line Segment on a Grid"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36303113-ba12-57e0-aa9a-971ea6bf5256" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446107} {:answer/id #uuid "47db7bb3-bbf7-56a0-8853-3874d8540483" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446112} {:answer/id #uuid "731f8a04-11fc-5918-bc53-b85904d9ca9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446120} {:answer/id #uuid "b1fae5a6-fd23-57ad-a08f-80aaafecd37b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446124} {:answer/id #uuid "c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446127}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c2acc43f-7be9-5978-9020-22741ba76b56" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\,\\text{m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446127} :answer-field/id #uuid "4410f461-24a9-548a-aea8-764d78323df6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446140}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b6e9a199-9ae7-5749-8e50-9bec321630b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-67642" :question/problem "![](images/d6/d67e2cb1a53f6063cf798294cbf077729bb3cf3621ba242325129b81dfe6c791.png)\n\nWhat is the measure of the line segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ shown above?" :question/worked-solution "Note that the length of a side of one cell is \n\n$$\n\\frac{6\\,\\text{m}}{3}=2\\,\\text{m}.\n$$\n\nThe line segment has a length of $6$ cells, hence the total measure is \n\n$$\nAB=6\\cdot 2\\,\\text{m}=12\\,\\text{m}.\n$$"}]}
